Rootform baseline policy pack
=============================

This directory is a synthetic public example of one Rootform Policy Pack.
It is provided under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The example references only the embedded RF Vocabulary and is provider-neutral
by design. Dependencies are derived during linking; source declares no
semantic versions and selects no provider Dialect. Policy blocks inside this
example never enter a Dialect artifact.

